<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-27T05:12:49.123Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:12:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Union Home Secretary Govind Mohan is reviewing the security situation in Jammu and Kashmir, calling for a decisive blow against terror and anti-infiltration measures while meeting top security officials. In Manipur, security forces rescued a man abducted for 20 days, arrested a PLA cadre and seized two phones, and destroyed 160 acres of illegal poppy plantations. In Chhattisgarh, forces recovered Rs 39.77 lakh from an underground Maoist cache. A member of the LG security team was killed in an accident in Ambala. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Telegraph India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNTUktNHFiMXY3WFh4VVdvdW1na1A5MERFUDhDbUlQQkNVdnhVMXFGNDIwZTc4ODBMeVRSaGdqaC1odm5TVGVmVlBTV3lPN3Jma1FTOEdqTnFtLWpjOERPWXd5ZzFtMEVVd1NNd2VOcTZvYnZNQXFWVGY0enJDckFaeEJlTExBeE5BcXhkeEFkdUlJUVRYMVJVQWNhZmZjMjM2R0JFcWNqZHY?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kashmir Horizon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOc3pRVW1hc0F5dUUyenQteTlvSDJoeE12YXRnOGZZS3FuRDBHeEZOUkx6RnJJNDRMT0R1REVnTnVkMjhoOWVWdktUMWVQbkw0dzB0MEZwemkwUUdTY2hGZTJLTmFTb3ZzcU0zaGdidi1yb1dXYjdhYndWVHoya29idjh0MG94d3MyUUpRS1hYZjdHTFdsNHQyYW5R?oc=5&quot;&gt;News On AIR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPZnAwbFMwWG9WelUyNE9CQ2dhamp3WjZKQmViUzh3Mm4tQ3FaTE9KSEVWSEFhMG12czBqdVhHb3pLRlNfNVJPTFRJZElyUldhdDRHczZpME94V3Uyd0lWOExzSkZOSERyOXZaMzdVMjRGX0tYUURBaFV5eHA1TXY2LV80bHo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Reader&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today NE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Organiser&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.g